{"source": "cues", "duration": 74.96, "audio": "voix-sfx.wav", "phrases": [{"id": "v01", "start": 0.63, "end": 3.16, "text": "Jacques knows his machine better than anyone.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-10-919-gil9h5.wav", "clip_start": 0.6, "clip_end": 3.4}, {"id": "v02", "start": 4.149, "end": 5.609, "text": "In a year, he retires.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-22-277-7e8xwk.wav", "clip_start": 4.119, "clip_end": 5.829}, {"id": "v03", "start": 6.676, "end": 11.316, "text": "And by 2030, twenty to thirty percent of technologists will retire too.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-27-972-zyhjbp.wav", "clip_start": 6.646, "clip_end": 11.517}, {"id": "v04", "start": 12.336, "end": 14.336, "text": "Their know-how isn't written down anywhere.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-31-656-vzx3qn.wav", "clip_start": 12.236, "clip_end": 14.606}, {"id": "v05", "start": 16.36, "end": 17.38, "text": "Meet Clip.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-07-59-574-bv7tzn.wav", "clip_start": 16.33, "clip_end": 17.63}, {"id": "v06", "start": 18.856, "end": 23.386, "text": "Film the expert while he explains. Clip records it all, right on the phone.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-37-048-xb1g99.wav", "clip_start": 18.826, "clip_end": 23.526}, {"id": "v07", "start": 24.254, "end": 28.444, "text": "Add photos, a voice note, or your old procedures in PDF and Word.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-50-008-piff70.wav", "clip_start": 24.224, "clip_end": 28.654}, {"id": "v08", "start": 29.382, "end": 33.212, "text": "Then, with a single button, AI writes the work instruction.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-54-243-fvsswz.wav", "clip_start": 29.352, "clip_end": 33.462}, {"id": "v09", "start": 34.19, "end": 38.9, "text": "One action per step, the right video clip, the warnings at the right time.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-08-59-613-cf0x0d.wav", "clip_start": 34.16, "clip_end": 39.08}, {"id": "v10", "start": 40.306, "end": 44.696, "text": "Edit with a word. Annotate with a click. Translate in seconds.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-05-929-paj103.wav", "clip_start": 40.276, "clip_end": 44.996}, {"id": "v11", "start": 45.686, "end": 50.856, "text": "And your old instructions? Drop them in by the dozen, and they come out modernized.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-18-552-q2w8us.wav", "clip_start": 45.656, "clip_end": 51.016}, {"id": "v12", "start": 51.84, "end": 57.79, "text": "Get it approved, then deploy it to the workstation, on a tablet or by QR code, no account needed.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-23-837-hn19i3.wav", "clip_start": 51.81, "clip_end": 58.02}, {"id": "v13", "start": 58.29, "end": 63.29, "text": "The operator follows each step, hears it read aloud, and flags what isn't clear.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-13-24-309-e1xwlm.wav", "clip_start": 58.26, "clip_end": 63.49}, {"id": "v14", "start": 63.93, "end": 66.3, "text": "And with one click, it exports to PDF.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-33-199-kpy03x.wav", "clip_start": 63.9, "clip_end": 66.69}, {"id": "v15", "start": 67.2, "end": 71.28, "text": "Clip. Your experts' know-how, at the workstation, in minutes.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-41-459-mzab5n.wav", "clip_start": 67.17, "clip_end": 71.62}, {"id": "v16", "start": 72.14, "end": 72.82, "text": "Book a demo.", "file": "work/clips/tts-gemini-2026-11-18T03-09-45-004-7vh1rj.wav", "clip_start": 72.11, "clip_end": 73.06}], "words": [[0.63, 0.92, "Jacques", "v01"], [0.92, 1.3, "knows", "v01"], [1.3, 1.5, "his", "v01"], [1.5, 1.96, "machine", "v01"], [1.96, 2.4, "better", "v01"], [2.4, 2.66, "than", "v01"], [2.66, 3.16, "anyone.", "v01"], [4.149, 4.269, "In", "v02"], [4.269, 4.389, "a", "v02"], [4.389, 4.689, "year,", "v02"], [5.009, 5.109, "he", "v02"], [5.109, 5.609, "retires.", "v02"], 